spec:
  grid: 19-23 rows x 19-30 cols, bg=0
  rectangle:
    color: 1 (base), fully filled (no bg inside), 9-13 rows x 9-10 cols
    placed with >=1 cell gap to every grid edge
    contains 3 marker pixels + 1 internal pattern of a 5th color
  markers:
    count: 3 distinct colors, each appears exactly once inside rect and once outside
    inside positions: at 3 of 4 near-corner slots (row 1 col 1, row 1 col W-2, row H-2 col 1, row H-2 col W-2)
    one corner slot is left empty; the 3 markers are non-collinear
    outside positions: 3 of 4 corners of their own bounding box, on bg, well separated from rect (Chebyshev >=4)
    external marker normalized layout == internal marker normalized layout in the correct orientation of crop
  internal_pattern:
    single extra color (not bg, not base, not any marker color), 9-15 pixels
    does not touch crop border, ~11-17% of crop area
    asymmetric under all 7 non-identity dihedral transformations (ensures unique orientation match)
  output: the crop rotated/reflected so internal markers match external marker layout
  colors: exactly 6 distinct values (bg + base + 3 markers + 1 pattern), all from 0-9

generation_strategy:
  approach: output-first
  steps:
    1. Pick crop dims H x W (9-13 x 9-10, not both equal unless pattern breaks symmetry).
    2. Fill crop with base color 1. Choose 3 of 4 near-corner slots; assign 3 distinct marker colors.
    3. Place 9-15 pixels of an internal pattern color, not touching crop border, ensuring the
       full crop is asymmetric under all 7 non-identity dihedral transforms.
    4. Choose a random dihedral orientation for the crop; that oriented crop is the output.
    5. Compute external marker normalized positions by reading marker positions from the output.
    6. Place external markers at those normalized positions offset to an empty region of the grid,
       >=4 Chebyshev distance from the rectangle, occupying 3 of 4 corners of their bounding box.
    7. Place the original (pre-orientation) crop on the bg=0 grid with >=1 cell gap to all edges,
       ensuring the external markers also fit. Grid size 19-23 x 19-30.
